:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Flying Ninja Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Ninja Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 50 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia/Miyazaki]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] decreases deploy cost and movement speed in exchange for losing [[Multi-Hit]] and a longer attack animation. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. To unlock her in [[The Battle Cats POP!]], you must clear Oita in Chapter 2 and spend 9000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she is unlocked from clearing Philippines in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 25 Cat Food.

